OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPatchy rain
OL,6,Facross the south dying out this
OL,7,Fevening, otherwise dry. Thickening
OL,8,Fcloud will bring patchy rain across
OL,9,Fthe south during the early hours.
OL,10,FChilly across Argyll.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FLight and patchy rain across
OL,13,Fthe south dying out in the morning.
OL,14,FOtherwise bright spells with a few
OL,15,Fshowers across Argyll, dry elsewhere.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
