OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,6,Fintervals and scattered showers on
OL,7,FWednesday. Dry on Thursday before rain
OL,8,Fspreads east in the evening. Early
OL,9,Frain on Friday followed by showers in
OL,10,Fthe north.
